  "claim_boundary": "This supervisor waits for exactly one complete branch-isolated research-analysis manifest, derives an outcome-aware publication/manuscript/audit dossier, and never treats physical non-equivalence, a null association, or experimental incompatibility as missing evidence. Its provenance amendments require both the hash-frozen 3x3x3 memory-safety chain and the exact source-transition equivalence certificate for the already-running universal occupancy-0 series. It may authorize a later qualitative journal-level review but cannot guarantee a CAS Q1 classification or acceptance.",
  "preregistration_note": "Versioned from v3 after the clean 700 K universal occupancy-0 point completed and an audit found that its process retained the 508f8cab source blobs while later commits added derived-supercell provenance validation and explicit paired-block metadata. The v1 source-equivalence certificate freezes both Git blobs and the exact diff, reproduces the stored raw-CIF structure fingerprint, and obtains byte-identical legacy transport values from all 5002 T700 frames. This v4 change is provenance-only: branch rules, scientific gates, thresholds, figure/table inventory, manuscript rules, and outcome semantics are unchanged. It precedes the T750 result, both 3x3x3 labels, every domain outcome, every supplemental formal run, and every final analysis/publication result.",
